title: "Compression Bench: A Digitally Controlled Compression Rig for Granular Media"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Kahrs
    given-names: Aron
    affiliation: Instituto de Física, Facultad de Ciencias, Universidad de la República, Montevideo, Uruguay
