repository-code: "https://github.com/AronKahrs-US/compression-bench"
url: "https://aronkahrs-us.github.io/compression-bench"

abstract: >
  Compression Bench is an open-source software package for controlling
  a digitally actuated compression rig used for the mechanical
  characterization of granular media. The software provides experiment
  configuration, real-time monitoring of force and displacement,
  automated data acquisition, visualization, and communication with an
  Arduino-based control system.

keywords:
  - granular media
  - compression testing
  - experimental physics
  - instrumentation
  - Arduino
  - load cell
  - stepper motor
  - laboratory automation